radar_unavailable.description:
Rain Radar Alarm has failed to download Bureau of Meteorology radar images several times in a row. Forecasts use Open-Meteo where that's turned on, or are unavailable.

Last error: {error}

This clears by itself once a download succeeds. If it persists, check that Home Assistant can reach ftp.bom.gov.au, and see the project's issue tracker in case BoM has changed its service.
